content mentioned as well as rewards for high scoring, cheat codes, and a few new surprises!</p>","developers":["Plumicorn Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141380/4cbba0b1e4b57869f6137a317dbf42ccb4dfa9f1/header.jpg?t=1762460782","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04, 18.04, or CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Can run on Steam Deck</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3141380/37383675/c2997711857512b9b6808b9f4cc29876e7a7629e/1750874421/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762460780","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3141380/37383675/c2997711857512b9b6808b9f4cc29876e7a7629e/1750874421/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762460780","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3141380/37383675/c2997711857512b9b6808b9f4cc29876e7a7629e/1750874421/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762460780","id":257042072,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257042072/movie480.mp4?t=1762460780","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257042072/movie_max.mp4?t=1762460780"},"name":"SUPERBUG: Mutations Update - Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257042072/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1762460780","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257042072/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1762460780","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257042072/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1762460780"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3141380/706171263/97dbe9988fa54ac60a74